                    Affairs of the Soviet Union; note not printed.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d729-f3" n="55" xml:id="d729-f3-content">
                <p>John Balfour, British Minister in the Soviet Union.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d729-f4" n="56" xml:id="d729-f4-content">
                <p>Not printed.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d729-f5" n="57" xml:id="d729-f5-content">
                <p>Representative of the Soviet Commissariat of Foreign Trade.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
